      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering External Providers**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a concrete external provider for text moderation and redaction within `redact_unsafe.py`. I'm leaning toward Google Cloud's Natural Language API as a likely candidate, but I'm still keeping options open to ensure a good fit. I will also make it identifiable.\n\n\n**Implementing Redaction Functionality**\n\nI've decided to start by creating the `redact_unsafe.py` file and implementing the basic structure of the redaction function. I'm focusing on using Google Cloud's Natural Language API, specifically the `language_v1` client, to analyze text for unsafe content. I've included a placeholder to make the API key or client initialization clearly identifiable. Currently, the implementation redacts unsafe spans, which is the immediate priority.\n\n\n",
