    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Natural Language API as the external provider for content moderation. I'll make sure to reflect this choice clearly within the code I'm writing. I'm keen on integrating this service.\n\n\n**Defining the Implementation**\n\nNow I have a clearer roadmap. I'm building `moderate_text.py` and creating a function to moderate text using Google Cloud's Natural Language API. I'm focusing on the core logic: receiving input, calling the API's `moderateText`, and returning the scores. I will avoid including details about API keys, assuming they are managed elsewhere.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860081042,
          "start": 1789860079461
        },
